{"id":"wb-6-138","name":"大师姑城址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大师姑城址","text":"大师姑城址位于河南省荥阳市广武镇大师姑村和杨寨村南地的索河二级台地上。城址始建于二里头文化二、三期之交，在二里头文化三期早段之前进行过大规模续建，约在二里头文化四期偏晚阶段至二里岗下层偏早阶段之间被废弃。\n关于大师姑城址的性质，学术上依然有争论。有研究认为其二里头城址有可能是夏王朝的东方军事重镇，有研究则认为其为是韦、顾等方国的都城，也有研究认为其为昆吾国都城。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%B8%88%E5%A7%91%E5%9F%8E%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86856333,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856333","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/09612836179de800eb8fe8c3.jpg","title":"20220209_Site_of_Dashigu.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20220209_Site_of_Dashigu.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/20220209_Site_of_Dashigu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Site of Dashigu","width":320,"height":213}}